   "label": "Director's calls  (the agent)\nfix mishearings using context\nmatch voices across parts\ntranslate for meaning, in the character's voice\nend each window in a pause, nobody else in it\nfit the translation to each window\nkeep names, songs and asides original, captioned\nmark each guess for the listen list",
   "shape": "rounded-rectangle",
   "nodeColor": "#8E24AA",
   "labelColor": "#ffffff",
   "parentId": "g4"
  },
