   "label": "Review speech boundaries with VAD\nEnd each window in a pause, nobody else in it\nUse complete phrases for voice references\nCombine embeddings, frames and context\nReword what a voice can't say\nUse only supported synthesis tags\nCheck each rendered line on its own\nAsk a listener to review acting and the mix",
